            "message": "{{#is_alert}}\n## P4 · Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry\n**WHAT:** Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry: telemetry_health signal detected by threshold analysis.\n**WHERE:** {{value}} · env `dev` · region `global`\n**SERVICE:** `application-platform` (application / service, tier3)\n**BUSINESS IMPACT:** Observability or configuration hygiene is degraded. No direct customer impact, but our ability to see or govern the estate is reduced.\n**WHY IT TRIGGERED:** Absence of telemetry is a binary condition. This is the monitor that guarantees \"no alerts\" never silently means \"no data\".\n\n**OWNER:** sre · support best-effort · this does not page\n**RUNBOOK:** attached to this monitor as `Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry` — open it from the monitor's Runbook asset.\n**AUTOMATED DIAGNOSTICS:** workflow `diag-app-health` has run; its output is attached to this event.\n**RELATED EVENTS:** correlated on `application-platform.dev.application-platform` — deployments, infrastructure changes and platform events from the last 30 minutes are attached as context.\n**SLO / ERROR BUDGET:** `slo-app-availability` · no error-budget impact (non-production)\n{{/is_alert}}\n{{#is_warning}}\n## Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry — warning\nApproaching the alert condition on {{value}}. Investigate before it becomes P4.\n{{/is_warning}}\n{{#is_no_data}}\n## Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry — NO DATA\nTelemetry stopped arriving for {{value}}. Treat this as a telemetry-health incident: an unmonitored resource is worse than an alerting one.\n{{/is_no_data}}\n{{#is_recovery}}\n## Recovered · Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry\n{{value}} returned to normal. Error-budget impact recorded against `slo-app-availability`. No action required; the correlation group closes when every child recovers.\n{{/is_recovery}}\n{{#is_warning_recovery}}\nWarning cleared for {{value}}.\n{{/is_warning_recovery}}",
            "monitor_threshold_windows": [],
            "monitor_thresholds": [
              {
                "critical": "1",
                "critical_recovery": "",
                "ok": "",
                "unknown": "",
                "warning": "",
                "warning_recovery": ""
              }
            ],
            "name": "[P4][dev][application] Application Stopped Reporting Telemetry (baseline)",
            "new_group_delay": 300,
            "new_host_delay": 300,
            "no_data_timeframe": 60,
            "notification_preset_name": "",
            "notify_audit": false,
            "notify_by": [],
